sequenceDiagram
participant UI as Settings UI
participant API as aiohttp handlers
participant CFG as ConfigService
participant Agent as Agent/AgentLoop
participant CMP as CompactionService
participant SCH as AgentScheduler
participant SUB as SubagentPool
participant PROF as ProfileComposer
UI->>API: GET /api/ai/config/schema
API->>CFG: get_schema()
CFG-->>API: schemas + revisions
API-->>UI: {ok,data,message}
UI->>API: PATCH config namespace, revision
API->>CFG: patch(namespace, payload, revision)
CFG-->>API: validated config/new revision
API-->>UI: result or STALE_REVISION
Agent->>CMP: compact_if_needed(log,messages)
CMP->>CMP: prune tool results + summarize old surface
CMP-->>Agent: replacement messages + CompactionResult
UI->>API: POST /api/ai/agent-schedule
API->>SCH: schedule_at/cron/every(spec)
SCH-->>API: SchedulerJob
API-->>UI: job
SUB->>SUB: validate capabilities + lineage depth
SUB->>Agent: run child with parent context
Agent-->>SUB: result/events
UI->>API: POST dangerous action preview
API-->>UI: preview token/diff
UI->>API: POST confirm(token)
API->>API: execute + append audit entry
API-->>UI: audit result
PROF->>PROF: load ordered bundle/profile patches
PROF-->>Agent: composed profile or conflict diagnostics
